      <details class="fold" id="full-practice">
        <summary><span class="fold-in">The full goodwill meditation, step by step</span></summary>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><span class="mk">1</span><div><p>Bring to mind someone you love.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="mk">2</span><div><p>Reflect that this person is a human being like you:</p>
            <ul class="chips"><li>Seeking happiness</li><li>Wishing not to suffer</li><li>Enduring hardships</li></ul></div></li>
          <li><span class="mk">3</span><div><p>Then mentally recite these phrases, using them as anchors for attention:</p>
            <p class="borrow-line phrases">{PHRASES.map((p) => <span>“{p}”</span>)}</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="mk">4</span><div><p>Repeat for any or all of the following:</p></div></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="rings-wrap">
